discuss an end to end data

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.730
science workflow
using Posit Team.

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.480
So this will be a
recurring event.

00:00:16.480 --> 00:00:19.500
We'll probably have it the
last Wednesday of every month

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.530
