tools within Posit team.

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:37.740
So Posit Workbench,
Posit Connect and Posit

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:39.540
Package Manager.

00:00:39.540 --> 00:00:41.260
And then after
each presentation,

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:43.440
we'll have a casual
discussion where

00:00:43.440 --> 00:00:46.260
folks can ask us questions,
Posit questions,

00:00:46.260 --> 00:00:50.250
or we can just discuss workflows
with other community members.

00:00:50.250 --> 00:00:52.680
So with that, let's go
ahead and get started.

00:00:52.680 --> 00:00:55.560
And I first want to
start and make sure

